### 2. Aspect Ratios  
   - RADIUS_RATIO: Captures variation in radii; might highlight asymmetry differences between classes like OPEL vs. BUS.  
   - PR.AXIS_ASPECT_RATIO and MAX.LENGTH_ASPECT_RATIO: Describe proportions of major/minor axes and lengths; useful for identifying elongation (BUS) vs. compact structures (SAAB).  

